WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.865
Module 9.

00:00:01.865 --> 00:00:03.830
DeFi vs Grid Bots.

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:05.865
Part of Stage 4, Strategist.

00:00:07.165 --> 00:00:09.275
By the end of this module, you'll be

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.442
able to choose the right tool for the

00:00:11.442 --> 00:00:14.080
market — and the natural bridge into GBB.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.435
That's the standard.

00:00:15.435 --> 00:00:17.405
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:18.705 --> 00:00:21.594
There are 3 lessons, starting with LP

00:00:21.594 --> 00:00:24.483
position vs grid bot: same idea (sell

00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:28.280
high/buy low inside a range), different risks.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.259
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:30.259 --> 00:00:32.530
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:35.417
If the topic is new to

00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:38.200
you, start with Mastery Starter 9.0.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.095
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:40.095 --> 00:00:42.249
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:42.249 --> 00:00:44.380
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:46.187
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:46.187 --> 00:00:48.220
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:52.065
Let's begin, with lesson 9.0.
